  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Explanation : **\n\nBODMAS Table\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nGiven equation : 84 * 6 * 25 * 13 * 3\n\nOption 1) ÷, +, =, × by subsituting these value according to BODMAS table we get\n\n**84 ÷ 6 **+ 25 = 13 × 3\n\n14 + 25 = **13 × 3**\n\n**14 + 25** = 39\n\n**39 = 39(LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) =, -, +, ×\n\n84 = 6 - 25 + **13 × 3**\n\n84 = **6** - 25** + 39**\n\n84 = 45 - 25\n\n84 ≠ 20(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ÷, =, ×\n\n84 + **6 ÷ 25** = 13 × 3\n\n84 + 0.24 = 13 × 3\n\n**84 + 0.24** = 39\n\n84.24 ≠ 39(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) -, -, =, +\n\n84 - 6** **- 25 = **13 + 3**\n\n**84 - 6 - 25** = 16\n\n**84 - 31** = 16\n\n53 ≠ 16(LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"÷, +, =, ×\"** is the correct answer.",
